67","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103723#issuecomment-2705123367","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103723","id":2705123367,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hPOgn","user":{"login":"StrawberrySmoothieDev","id":65236603,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MjM2NjAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65236603?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev","html_url":"https://github.com/StrawberrySmoothieDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-06T22:56:16Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T22:56:16Z","body":"> The MRP has `run/max_fps=60`, make sure to remove it before running the project or you'll be capped at 60 FPS. You can also use `--max-fps 0` on the command line to bypass it.\n> \n> I get a black screen when running the MRP in 4.3 (even after resetting it to a clean state), so I can't compare performance between 4.3 and 4.4 here.\n\nThe 60FPS would not have affected my testing, but it probably would on other (more powerful) devices. Also can you elaborate on the black screen issue? Does it happen in-editor?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705123367/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705124147","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103723#issuecomment-2705124147","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103723","id":2705124147,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hPOsz","user":{"login":"StrawberrySmoothieDev","id":65236603,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MjM2NjAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65236603?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev","html_url":"https://github.com/StrawberrySmoothieDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-06T22:56:51Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T22:56:51Z","body":"> The MRP has `run/max_fps=60`, make sure to remove it before running the project or you'll be capped at 60 FPS. You can also use `--max-fps 0` on the command line to bypass it.\n> \n> I get a black screen when running the MRP in 4.3 (even after resetting it to a clean state), so I can't compare performance between 4.3 and 4.4 he