\n- using Forward+ Vulkan backend : black screen\n- using Compatibility backend : 120fps stable and smooth, no stutter\n\nLet me know if I can be of any help to benchmark other scenarios!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706025636/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706496769","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103723#issuecomment-2706496769","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103723","id":2706496769,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hUd0B","user":{"login":"StrawberrySmoothieDev","id":65236603,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MjM2NjAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65236603?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev","html_url":"https://github.com/StrawberrySmoothieDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StrawberrySmoothieDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T13:47:32Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T13:47:32Z","body":"> Opening this MRP with vulkan renderingdevice (ins